; pw-b-fix1177-01 - expression matrix, AmiBlitz3 test of
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/pw-B-fix1177-01.bas: 4 of its 4 cells
; the checks have the values of blitz2-ab3 -r in AB3 mode (the port's
; compiler with AmiBlitz3's libraries); AmiBlitz3's measured values of 4
; cells differ, the deviations of its cells (pw-b-fix1177-01.test.toml,
; docs/ab3/variant.md)
; generated by exprmatrix expect from
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/matrix.txt (tools/exprmatrix/README.md);
; do not edit
DEFTYPE .w gw
Statement pw{x.w}
  SHARED gw
  gw=x
End Statement
!TestCase{cells}
  vl.l=-100000 : vq.q=-1.5
  pw{vq < vl} : !CheckEq{gw,0,"pw-lt-q-l-B"}
  pw{vq <= vl} : !CheckEq{gw,0,"pw-le-q-l-B"}
  pw{vq > vl} : !CheckEq{gw,-1,"pw-gt-q-l-B"}
  pw{vq >= vl} : !CheckEq{gw,-1,"pw-ge-q-l-B"}
!EndTestCase
